    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBeautifully presented two bedroom apartment located in a quiet and well-maintained development just off the Western Distributor Road in Knocknacarra. The area is well serviced and this particular development is a 3 minute walk from the Gateway Shopping Centre with Dunnes Stores & B&Q as the anchor tenants. The Clybaun Hotel, Sheridan's Bar & Restaurant, primary & secondary schools and Salthill village are all is within easy reach.\n\nConstructed circa 2004, number 96 Altan is positioned favourably on the top floor in a secure block with elevator, west facing aspect and a balcony which is one of 4 larger ones in the block. The accommodation is bright, spacious and very well laid out to include entrance hall, kitchen, living, two bedrooms and main bathroom. The owner has presented it perfectly to the market and it is ready for immediate use."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nSpacious entry with timber flooring, coved ceiling and hot press with good storage.\n\nKitchen Dining: - \nTiled floor, built in timber kitchen, integrated oven & hob, tiled splashback, plumbed for washing machine, coved ceiling.\n\nLiving Room: - \nBright space with timber floor, tv point, coved ceiling, opens onto west facing balcony with elevated views.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nLarge spacious room with timber flooring, side aspect window, fitted wardobe, coved ceiling, tv point.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble room with timber flooring, side aspect window, fitted wardobe, coved ceiling, tv point.\n\nBathroom: - \nWC, wash hand basin, bath with showerhead, tiled wet areas.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully presented</li><li>Ready for immediate use</li><li>Secure block with serviced lift</li><li>Elevated, west facing balcony with nice views</li><li>Parking</li><li>Electric heating</ul>"
      },
      {
